# Template only. Copy to .env.local and put real values there — .env.local is
# gitignored, this file is committed to a public repository.

# The canonical origin is NOT read from here any more — it lives in
# lib/site-config.ts as SITE_URL. This variable was left pointing at
# https://handle.vn after the domain moved, and since handle.vn does not
# resolve, every canonical on the live site was telling Google to index a
# domain that does not exist. Delete it from Vercel; nothing reads it.

# Search Console / Bing ownership tokens, if you verify by meta tag rather than
# by DNS. Leave unset and no verification tag is emitted at all — an empty one
# fails verification rather than being ignored.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=
NEXT_PUBLIC_BING_SITE_VERIFICATION=

# Supabase, for the consultation form. Optional: leave these unset and the site
# runs normally, with the form reporting a failure instead of writing a row.
# Set both or neither — half-configured is the one state that is not handled.
#
# Both are public values: the anon key ships in the browser bundle either way,
# so what actually protects submitted data is the Row Level Security policy on
# `consultation_requests`. Confirm anon is allowed to INSERT and nothing else
# before pointing this at a real project.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=your-project-url
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
